    "detailed_description": "A short visual story game. Alongside native adayo and descendants of genetically engineered crows, human nations are rebuilding on planet Tresmir, centuries after a cataclysmic war. Young human Alf\u00f3n has entered the camp of adayo prophet Tisik, searching for something that matters to him.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay is pure dialogue, with branching choices. Playing as Alf\u00f3n, you choose your outcome by the things you say. With a handful of characters, emphasis is on branching conversation. Designed for replay, what you learn about Alf\u00f3n, Tisik, and others will affect the choices you make each time through.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlso includes an easy-to-use coloring book feature, because coloring books rock. Choose your own colors!",
    "about_the_game": "A short visual story game. Alongside native adayo and descendants of genetically engineered crows, human nations are rebuilding on planet Tresmir, centuries after a cataclysmic war. Young human Alf\u00f3n has entered the camp of adayo prophet Tisik, searching for something that matters to him.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay is pure dialogue, with branching choices. Playing as Alf\u00f3n, you choose your outcome by the things you say. With a handful of characters, emphasis is on branching conversation. Designed for replay, what you learn about Alf\u00f3n, Tisik, and others will affect the choices you make each time through.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlso includes an easy-to-use coloring book feature, because coloring books rock. Choose your own colors!",
